   "lines": [
    "All my Bostonian",
    "friends have been",
    "very hospitable",
    "and kind; and",
    "by so doing have",
    "added wonderfully",
    "to the enjoyment",
    "of my college",
    "course. Jack",
    "Tebbets[?] has just",
    "asked me to",
    "spend a month",
    "with him at",
    "Schooner Head and",
    "Harry ^Shaw^ wishes me",
    "to stay with him",
    "next Sunday.",
    "Our Club Table"
   ],
